  "slug": "jalapeno-hummus",
  "name": "Jalape\u00f1o Hummus",
  "recipe_type": "appetizer",
  "brief_description": "This jalape\u00f1o hummus is made by blending chickpeas, jalape\u00f1o peppers, garlic, cumin, and tahini to make a delicious dip that'll liven up any party!",
  "cuisine": "Greek",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Place chickpeas, jalape\u00f1o peppers and reserved juice, tahini, garlic, and lemon juice in a blender or food processor; season with cumin, curry powder, and crushed red pepper. Blend until smooth."
    }
  ],
